        "title": "Bui khang jangsini cho?",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Bui khang jangsini cho, ringmei chang tatmei khang,",
            "Rianramei pat louna Raguang khou bam kanthe;",
            "Neila na tingkau ku kan the,",
            "Jisu dang khou 2!- banthai khang.",
            "",
            "2. Tat dukan the rianra rianriu mak pui bam khou,",
            "Sunu naonian mei mak, kagan kalai dat mak;",
            "Tingkau kandih Raguang ram khou,",
            "Khrista Jisu le lung cham khang.",
            "",
            "3. Chunsina bam ri-o, jangsina bam ri-o,",
            "Kandih rianra hei ju gan louna kukan the;",
            "Kapma huai bammei 2!- ruina,",
            "Kari keidat pukhang ram the.",
            "",
            "4. Chunsi jangsimei mak, mikdui ni kei dat mak,",
            "Hei ram khou 2!- aniu guaini kupuni;",
            "Hei kandih hei ganlou duna,",
            "Aniu nuina tat puni e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
